<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <title>Bem Vindo!</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link
      href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Roboto:wght@300&family=Sigmar&display=swap"
      rel="stylesheet"
    />
    <style>
      body {
        color: #333;
        font-size: 1.1rem;
        background: #eee;
        font-family: 'Roboto', sans-serif;
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
      }

      header {
        padding: 0.8rem 1rem;
        font-family: 'Sigmar', cursive;
        font-size: 1.4rem;
      }

      main {
        color: #eee;
        background: #333;
        padding: 3rem 1rem;
      }

      table {
        margin: auto;
      }

      td {
        padding: 8px 0;
      }

      footer {
        padding: 1rem;
        font-size: 0.8rem;
      }

      a {
        text-decoration: none;
        color: unset;
      }

      h1 {
        font-size: 2rem;
        padding: 0;
        margin: 0;
      }

      .button {
        color: #eee;
        background: #2c4e7d;
        border: none;
        padding: 8px 16px;
        border-radius: 4px;
        cursor: pointer;
        text-transform: uppercase;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <header>
      <a href="{{app-link}}">Meu Portfólio</a>
    </header>
    <main>
      <table>
        <tr>
          <td align="center">
            <?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?><!-- Uploaded to: SVG Repo, www.svgrepo.com, Generator: SVG Repo Mixer Tools -->
            <svg
              width="80px"
              height="80px"
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
              fill="none"
              xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
            >
              <circle cx="12" cy="9" r="3" stroke="#eee" stroke-width="1.5" />
              <path
                d="M17.9691 20C17.81 17.1085 16.9247 15 11.9999 15C7.07521 15 6.18991 17.1085 6.03076 20"
                stroke="#eee"
                stroke-width="1.5"
                stroke-linecap="round"
              />
              <path
                d="M7 3.33782C8.47087 2.48697 10.1786 2 12 2C17.5228 2 22 6.47715 22 12C22 17.5228 17.5228 22 12 22C6.47715 22 2 17.5228 2 12C2 10.1786 2.48697 8.47087 3.33782 7"
                stroke="#eee"
                stroke-width="1.5"
                stroke-linecap="round"
              />
            </svg>
          </td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td align="center">
            <h1>Bem vindo {{username}}!</h1>
          </td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td align="center">
            Sua conta está quase pronta para uso.<br/>Finalize seu cadastro,
            configurando uma senha para seu usuário.
          </td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td align="center">
            <a class="button" href="{{password-link}}">Configurar senha</a>
          </td>
        </tr>
      </table>
    </main>
    <footer>© 2024 Meu Portfólio</footer>
  </body>
</html>
